        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) An Employee being retired under the Pension Plan will be granted, prior to retirement, vacation with pay to which eligible; however, when Employee (1) is retired on service pension which becomes effective immediately upon expiration or termination of Sickness Disability Benefits to which eligible, (2) is retired on disability pension, no vacation with pay or allowance in lieu thereof shall be applicable.",
            "block_bbox": [
