        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) No vacation or allowance in lieu thereof shall be granted to an Employee (a) who is dismissed for unsatisfactory conduct or (b) who resigns following reinstatement from Leave of Absence or rehire unless the Employee has been on the active roll for at least three (3) months prior to such resignation.",
